            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h1>TERAHARD UPCOMING</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656580/extras/7fa98fd34cb168f970eae0a6a5c884c9.poster.avif?t=1690539771\" width=616 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656580/extras/7fa98fd34cb168f970eae0a6a5c884c9.webm?t=1690539771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656580/extras/7fa98fd34cb168f970eae0a6a5c884c9.mp4?t=1690539771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><i>Punch and claw your way through forty fast paced levels of pure mayhem, while honing your Ninja Cat skills, in order to rescue your Master from the evil claws of an unknown enemy.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656580/extras/4fd647366e371e9f3601f0edddc2cbfc.avif?t=1690539771\" width=600 height=352 /></span><br><strong>Claws of Furry</strong> creates a blend of today's fast paced action with classic arcade Beat'em up badassery. With four distinct environments with unique enemies, the challenge is always evolving. Multiple modes such as Rogue-like and Arena, and unlockable outfits with unique bonuses, will keep you coming back for more. Fear not the rogue-like though; with the Pussycat mode you can play the game with checkpoints in every level, in a classic linear adventure. This will not make it much easier though, fast reflexes and a keen eye are required in order to survive the journey to free your Master. You don't have to take this journey alone though; <strong>you can have a group of up to four people in local co-op</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656580/extras/aa759b35c09d0dbc5457e669b76d5779.avif?t=1690539771\" width=600 height=352 /></span><br>• Arcade beat'em up action.<br>• Multiple Modes.<br>• Local co-op with up to 4 players.<br>• A variety of thematic environments and enemies.<br>• Beautiful hand-painted art.<br>• Unique character design.<br><br><strong>Modes</strong><br><strong><i>• Pussycat</i></strong><br>The regular campaign mode which is consisted by 44 thematically varied levels. Your progress of the players is saved each level. Up to 4 players in local co-op.<br><strong><i>• Im-paw-ssible!</i></strong><br>Take the <i>Pussycat</i> journey, but in <strong>Rogue-like</strong> fashion. The stage progress resets with every death. Fear not the Rogue-like though; the character progress is not lost, since the costumes that are unlocked are saved; and ninja cats from other modes will be available as well. Up to 4 players in local  co-op.<br><strong><i>• Catrmageddon</i></strong><br>Survival arena mode. Try survive wave after wave of enemies for as long as possible. Up to 4 players in local co-op.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656580/extras/68c59c8bdd1aab72fda50bbd6698e49b.avif?t=1690539771\" width=600 height=352 /></span><br>Your Ninja Master was abducted before your eyes! Pursue his tracks through the territories of your sworn enemies and free him from captivity! Be vigilant though; not everything is what it seems...<br><br>Story in Claws of Furry follows the old-school arcade path, meaning that less is more. The narrative has linear progression, with short cutscenes that progress the story, but fear not; the game focuses on what you really want: <strong>punching things</strong>.",
            "about_the_game": "<i>Punch and claw your way through forty fast paced levels of pure mayhem, while honing your Ninja Cat skills, in order to rescue your Master from the evil claws of an unknown enemy.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656580/extras/4fd647366e371e9f3601f0edddc2cbfc.avif?t=1690539771\" width=600 height=352 /></span><br><strong>Claws of Furry</strong> creates a blend of today's fast paced action with classic arcade Beat'em up badassery. With four distinct environments with unique enemies, the challenge is always evolving. Multiple modes such as Rogue-like and Arena, and unlockable outfits with unique bonuses, will keep you coming back for more. Fear not the rogue-like though; with the Pussycat mode you can play the game with checkpoints in every level, in a classic linear adventure. This will not make it much easier though, fast reflexes and a keen eye are required in order to survive the journey to free your Master. You don't have to take this journey alone though; <strong>you can have a group of up to four people in local co-op</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656580/extras/aa759b35c09d0dbc5457e669b76d5779.avif?t=1690539771\" width=600 height=352 /></span><br>• Arcade beat'em up action.<br>• Multiple Modes.<br>• Local co-op with up to 4 players.<br>• A variety of thematic environments and enemies.<br>• Beautiful hand-painted art.<br>• Unique character design.<br><br><strong>Modes</strong><br><strong><i>• Pussycat</i></strong><br>The regular campaign mode which is consisted by 44 thematically varied levels. Your progress of the players is saved each level. Up to 4 players in local co-op.<br><strong><i>• Im-paw-ssible!</i></strong><br>Take the <i>Pussycat</i> journey, but in <strong>Rogue-like</strong> fashion. The stage progress resets with every death. Fear not the Rogue-like though; the character progress is not lost, since the costumes that are unlocked are saved; and ninja cats from other modes will be available as well. Up to 4 players in local  co-op.<br><strong><i>• Catrmageddon</i></strong><br>Survival arena mode. Try survive wave after wave of enemies for as long as possible. Up to 4 players in local co-op.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656580/extras/68c59c8bdd1aab72fda50bbd6698e49b.avif?t=1690539771\" width=600 height=352 /></span><br>Your Ninja Master was abducted before your eyes! Pursue his tracks through the territories of your sworn enemies and free him from captivity! Be vigilant though; not everything is what it seems...<br><br>Story in Claws of Furry follows the old-school arcade path, meaning that less is more. The narrative has linear progression, with short cutscenes that progress the story, but fear not; the game focuses on what you really want: <strong>punching things</strong>.",
