            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1)<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 2.0 Ghz Dual-Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 1 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> ATI Radeon HD 2600 or better / NVIDIA GeForce 8600 or better, 256MB video memory, with Shader Model 2 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 3600 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectSound-compatible sound device<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Internet connection is NOT required to play PVE but is required for PVP</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1) / Windows 8.1 / Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Quad-Core or better<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 260 or AMD Radeon HD 4770 or better (1GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 12<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 3600 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectSound-compatible sound device<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Internet connection is NOT required to play PVE but is required for PVP</li></ul>"
